      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `4180c68609c58b96886f528c2657a82d1d75dd09b28f44ddb25e81989cbc6540--45300DO001_201011.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Crime Victimisation, Australia (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2010-11\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 9 of 9\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | 7f02297f8ad065eff4b0ea70a51a77a4f6f6ecadf5d85c7523aee3d204c94c21 | missing |\n| \"Table 1\" | 23fada31a2a5f765d1180c79b1ebe61912833be63e8a062ab7e82ea14e9960e2 | missing |\n| \"Table 1a\" | cf3cf41ee25c6aac0a9f938351203c23f36bfd68c554587d7e3fe4c28535f312 | missing |\n| \"Table 2\" | 4b25cc71f213bee3ee7080c914f33bbeba9e5e876a7671bc485d51536ac8e28a | missing |\n| \"Table 2a\" | 66ac022c6964282c19cd803c58320ae113becdf4e79c7f663d66665e9c60d378 | missing |\n| \"Table 3\" | 116cc2eaaa5a7a9a0481cd821bb5c6caaddc9e445933f6773b6c141c82822d45 | missing |\n| \"Table 3a\" | 51077c3933202ef3f0800c6decaa1394bc6b67accab05c2a5aa0b2d76668ee56 | missing |\n| \"Table 4\" | 76fb8797e88708ba39aa398d35c29a597fb584b23eba300c8ecad75ce5a6a08a | missing |\n| \"Table 4a\" | b73a5dad983dca7972a5d7cec12ca7b1ccc85a7f4e9c604c30346ae688e32052 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
